	(descr "BA1K-3AA foil strain gauge. Backing 7.00 mm along the sensitive axis (X) by 4.20 mm (Y), centered at 0,0. Two SMD pads on the +X short end, which is the right edge in the reference photo (wires leave that edge). Each pad is 1.64 mm along X and 1.24 mm along Y, with a 0.70 mm gap and the outer pad edge 1.00 mm in from the +X backing edge. Pad 1 is the upper pad in that photo (negative Y); pad 2 is the lower pad. Pads are centered across the width. Photo scaled so the yellow backing is exactly 7.00 x 4.20 mm (351.4 px by 234.6 px; the photo aspect is 1.50 rather than 1.67, so the axes were scaled separately) measured each pad about 1.58 mm along X by 1.15 mm along Y, gap about 0.56 mm, and inset from the photo's right edge about 1.19 mm. Footprint uses the stated 1.64 x 1.24 mm, 0.70 mm gap, and 1.00 mm inset.")
